        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Established custom, in speaking and writing, is the standard to which we must at last resort for determining every controverted point in language and style.\n—HUGH BLAIR",
            "block_bbox": [
                106,
                371,
                767,
                438
            ],
            "block_id": 1,
            "block_order": 2,
            "group_id": 1,
            "global_block_id": 1,
            "global_group_id": 1,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    106.0,
                    371.0
                ],
                [
                    767.0,
                    371.0
                ],
                [
                    767.0,
                    438.0
                ],
                [
                    106.0,
                    438.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "To careful writers, nothing is more important than choice, for choice is what allows them to express themselves clearly and precisely. Which of these sentences would you choose to give to your readers?",
            "block_bbox": [
                91,
                469,
                783,
                547
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 3,
            "group_id": 2,
            "global_block_id": 2,
            "global_group_id": 2,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    91.0,
                    469.0
                ],
                [
                    783.0,
                    469.0
                ],
                [
                    783.0,
                    547.0
                ],
                [
                    91.0,
                    547.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "A lack of sufficient funding was the cause of the program's failure.",
            "block_bbox": [
                126,
                558,
                636,
                584
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 3,
            "global_block_id": 3,
            "global_group_id": 3,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    126.0,
                    558.0
                ],
                [
                    636.0,
                    558.0
                ],
                [
                    636.0,
                    584.0
                ],
                [
                    126.0,
                    584.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The program failed because it was underfunded.",
            "block_bbox": [
                127,
                600,
                502,
                625
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 4,
            "global_block_id": 4,
            "global_group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    127.0,
                    600.0
                ],
                [
                    502.0,
                    600.0
                ],
                [
                    502.0,
                    625.0
                ],
                [
                    127.0,
                    625.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Both are grammatically correct, but most of us would choose the second because it feels more direct.",
            "block_bbox": [
                91,
                642,
                782,
                692
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 5,
            "global_block_id": 5,
            "global_group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    91.0,
                    642.0
                ],
                [
                    782.0,
                    642.0
                ],
                [
                    782.0,
                    692.0
                ],
                [
                    91.0,
                    692.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "It is good to write correctly, but correctness in writing is not the highest good. If you obsess over every rule you can find in a handbook, you deny yourself the freedom you need to write quickly and clearly. That's why we're addressing correctness now, before we turn to clarity: to put it where it belongs—behind us.",
            "block_bbox": [
                90,
                695,
                784,
                799
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 7,
            "group_id": 6,
            "global_block_id": 6,
            "global_group_id": 6,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    90.0,
                    695.0
                ],
                [
                    784.0,
                    695.0
                ],
                [
                    784.0,
                    799.0
                ],
                [
                    90.0,
                    799.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "The Authority of Standard English",
            "block_bbox": [
                91,
                822,
                527,
                854
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 8,
            "group_id": 7,
            "global_block_id": 7,
            "global_group_id": 7,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    91.0,
                    822.0
                ],
                [
                    527.0,
                    822.0
                ],
                [
                    527.0,
                    854.0
                ],
                [
                    91.0,
                    854.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Some try to stay safe by memorizing and following dozens of alleged “rules” of correct grammar and usage. You could, for instance, adopt a worst-case policy: obey all the rules all the time because eventually, someone will criticize you for something—for beginning a sentence with and or ending it with up. But if you try to obey all the rules all the time, you risk tving yourself in knots.",
            "block_bbox": [
                90,
                867,
                783,
                995
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 9,
            "group_id": 8,
            "global_block_id": 8,
            "global_group_id": 8,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    90.0001220703125,
                    867.0
                ],
                [
                    782.0,
                    867.0
                ],
                [
                    782.0,
                    988.0
                ],
                [
                    90.0001220703125,
                    988.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The alternative to blind obedience is selective observance. But then you have to decide which rules to observe and which to ignore. If you don’t follow a rule you should, you risk being labeled ignorant, uneducated, or worse. And if you choose to ignore a rule for sound reasons, you may encounter someone who, infatuated with “good” grammar, sees your split infinitive as an unmistakable sign of a more general social decay. If you want to avoid being accused of “lacking standards” but refuse to submit to whatever “rule” someone can dredge up from ninth-grade English, you have to know more about these rules than the rule-mongers do.",
            "block_bbox": [
                90,
                997,
                785,
                1205
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 10,
            "group_id": 9,
            "global_block_id": 9,
            "global_group_id": 9,
            "block_polygon_points": [
